{"words": [{"text": "زُيِّنَ", "translation": "Beautified"}, {"text": "لِلَّذِينَ", "translation": "for those who"}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translation": "disbelieve[d]"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ", "translation": "(is) the life"}, {"text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "translation": "(of) the world"}, {"text": "وَيَسْخَرُونَ", "translation": "and they ridicule"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "[of]"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟ ۘ", "translation": "believe[d]"}, {"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "And those who"}, {"text": "ٱتَّقَوْا۟", "translation": "fear (Allah)"}, {"text": "فَوْقَهُمْ", "translation": "(they will be) above them"}, {"text": "يَوْمَ", "translation": "(on the) Day"}, {"text": "ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ", "translation": "(of) Resurrection"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "يَرْزُقُ", "translation": "provides"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "whom"}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ", "translation": "He wills"}, {"text": "بِغَيْرِ", "translation": "without"}, {"text": "حِسَابٍۢ", "translation": "measure"}], "sahih": "Beautified for those who disbelieve is the life of this world, and they ridicule those who believe. But those who fear Allāh are above them on the Day of Resurrection. And Allāh gives provision to whom He wills without account."}